@page "/components/label"

<PageTitle>Label - BaseRz</PageTitle>

<h1>Label</h1>
<p><code>BaseLabelRoot</code> is a native <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>; <code>For</code> associates it with a control by id.</p>

<div style="max-width: 24rem">
    <BaseLabelRoot For="email" class="form-label">Email address</BaseLabelRoot>
    <input id="email" type="email" class="form-control" placeholder="you@example.com" />
</div>
